{"id":"ecf74ed22706d6a5","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-reduction.md","title":"Reduction","display":"df-reduction — Reduction","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-reduction","aliases":["88-df-reduction"],"display":"df-reduction — Reduction","depends_on":["[[88-df-many-one-reducible]]","[[88-df-computable-function]]","[[88-df-injective]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-reduction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-reduction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-reduction — Reduction"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"87fbc479272c5469\" href=\"?note=87fbc479272c5469\" title=\"88-df-many-one-reducible\">88-df-many-one-reducible</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"64279ecae5246baf\" href=\"?note=64279ecae5246baf\" title=\"88-df-computable-function\">88-df-computable-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"186aad749d027077\" href=\"?note=186aad749d027077\" title=\"88-df-injective\">88-df-injective</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A, B \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}\">\\(A, B \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (sets)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Comp}(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{Comp}(f)\\)</span> (computability predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"64279ecae5246baf\" href=\"?note=64279ecae5246baf\" title=\"88-df-computable-function\">88-df-computable-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Injective}(f,\\mathbb{N},\\mathbb{N})\">\\(\\mathrm{Injective}(f,\\mathbb{N},\\mathbb{N})\\)</span> (injectivity predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"186aad749d027077\" href=\"?note=186aad749d027077\" title=\"88-df-injective\">88-df-injective</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\deg_m(A)\">\\(\\deg_m(A)\\)</span> (many-one degree)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}reduction} \\vdash\nA\\leq_1B\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists f\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Comp}(f)\n\\land\\mathrm{dom}(f)=\\mathbb N\n\\land\\mathrm{Injective}(f,\\mathbb N,\\mathbb N)\n\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;(x\\in A\\leftrightarrow f(x)\\in B)\n\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}reduction} \\vdash\nA\\leq_1B\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists f\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Comp}(f)\n\\land\\mathrm{dom}(f)=\\mathbb N\n\\land\\mathrm{Injective}(f,\\mathbb N,\\mathbb N)\n\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;(x\\in A\\leftrightarrow f(x)\\in B)\n\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}reduction} \\vdash\nA\\equiv_mB\n\\leftrightarrow\nA\\leq_mB\\land B\\leq_mA\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}reduction} \\vdash\nA\\equiv_mB\n\\leftrightarrow\nA\\leq_mB\\land B\\leq_mA\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}reduction} \\vdash\n\\deg_m(A)\\coloneqq\n\\{B\\subseteq\\mathbb N:B\\equiv_mA\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}reduction} \\vdash\n\\deg_m(A)\\coloneqq\n\\{B\\subseteq\\mathbb N:B\\equiv_mA\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：<